  <sparkle:version>1.0.3</sparkle:version>
  <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
  <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
  <description><![CDATA[<style>body{font:13px -apple-system,system-ui;margin:0;padding:0;color:#111}h2{font-size:15px;margin:0 0 8px}h3{font-size:13px;margin:12px 0 4px}ul{margin:0;padding-left:18px}li{margin-bottom:6px}code{font:11px ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo;background:rgba(127,127,127,.15);padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px}@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){body{color:#eee}}</style><h2>Version 1.0.3</h2><ul><li>The project order you pick in Settings now applies to the All tab as well as Running.</li><li>Removed the Recently Used order, which only knew about projects you had started from the menu bar. Recently Started replaces it, and anyone using it is moved across.</li><li>The icons along the bottom of the panel now match each other, and brighten as you point at them. The tabs and the search button highlight on hover too.</li></ul>]]></description>
